{"3799570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CriminalZ", "steam_appid": 3799570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799570/extras/56162e46dc6446cc27560e00a0f2db2f.avif?t=1785775638\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799570/extras_big/56162e46dc6446cc27560e00a0f2db2f.avif?t=1785775638 width=1560 height=584 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799570/extras/5d667076bbcfa5974c662abfbb81b192.avif?t=1785775638\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799570/extras_big/5d667076bbcfa5974c662abfbb81b192.avif?t=1785775638 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CriminalZ is a 1–4 player co-op crime roguelite where every paid quota makes the Boss demand more.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run risky jobs, earn cash, pay the quota, upgrade your gear, and face a bigger challenge in the next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deal, steal, break in, and hack your way to enough money before time runs out — but if you miss the quota or get caught, the run is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure still helps you improve, so every crew comes back sharper, better equipped, and ready for bigger risks. <br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799570/extras/e393d56611f43c419d8fba7838d7c145.avif?t=1785775638\" width=800 height=295 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hacker</strong> – Disable cameras, crack terminals, and drain locked systems.<br><strong>Breaker</strong> – Smash safes, registers, and reinforced doors.<br><strong>Stealer</strong> – Pick pockets, rob apartments, and grab valuables fast.<br><strong>Dealer</strong> – Grow, refine, and sell Woosh to the right buyers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799570/extras/e2ece0352783b790d764bbb0c6e75af0.poster.avif?t=1785775638\" width=800 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799570/extras/e2ece0352783b790d764bbb0c6e75af0.webm?t=1785775638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799570/extras/e2ece0352783b790d764bbb0c6e75af0.mp4?t=1785775638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799570/extras/ba957a6738e2b51e06153ee35280a917.avif?t=1785775638\" width=800 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><strong>Improve your tools</strong> to break in, hack, steal, and escape more effectively.<br><strong>Increase loot value</strong> to earn more from every risky job.<br><strong>Strengthen your crew</strong> and become harder to catch.<br><strong>Prepare for bigger quotas</strong> as the Boss keeps demanding more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799570/extras/ba95f14de044eef5a35c326534e41c64.poster.avif?t=1785775638\" width=800 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799570/extras/ba95f14de044eef5a35c326534e41c64.webm?t=1785775638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source